    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Angelic Inheritors",
    "summary": "As the first [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) begins, pick 2 Angelic Legacy abilities from the list below. Both stay active for the rest of the battle, and your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES CHARACTER** units get them. The abilities are:\n\n- **Sanguinary Grace**: making a [fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) in a turn leaves the unit free to shoot and to declare a charge in that turn.\n- **Carmine Wrath**: attacks by the unit's models can re-roll 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) and 1s to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).\n- **Their Appointed Hour**: the unit can re-roll its [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).",
